%rec: default
# Heaven & Hell's sound events: its own and Abaddon's effects (sfx/) and the Dubtrain Angband Sound Pack
# (ang_sfx/), never Diablo's. Remap with ./remap_sounds.sh (sfxmapper) like any mod.

